CT,25,T
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F496A1776179904
OL,1,Vk4                               G7/19
OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~sGNEGOTIATONS RESUMED
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5pGAT STRANGEWAYS JAIL
OL,4,D
OL,5, The authorities at Strangeways jail in
OL,6, Manchester say they have resumed
OL,7, negotiations with the remaining inmates
OL,9,FAbout 10 prisoners remain inside the
OL,10,Fprison after a siege which has lasted
OL,11,F14 days.
OL,13,FTwo more prisoners gave up yesterday,
OL,14,Fbut none has surrendered so far
OL,15,Ftoday.
OL,17,FSome of the inmates have spent much of
OL,18,Fthe day on the prison roof. One of
OL,19,Fthem said they would not give in
OL,20,Ftomorrow as promised, but on Tuesday.
OL,22,D]F This Ceefax page is fromG14-04-90
OL,23,D]F Much more at: teletextarchive.com
