OL,1,Vk4                              G10/19
OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~sGPAKISTAN PUTS ARMED
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5pGFORCES ON ALERT
OL,5, Pakistan has put its armed forces on
OL,6, alert following the growing tension
OL,7, with India over Kashmir.
OL,9,FPakistan's minister of state for
OL,10,Fdefence said the armed forces were on
OL,11,F"high state of preparedness and
OL,12,Fvigilance to meet any external threat".
OL,14,FEarlier, Indian prime minister VP Singh
OL,15,Faccused Pakistan of preparing to go to
OL,16,Fwar over the situation in Kashmir.
OL,18,FTensions have been rising between the
OL,19,Ftwo countries over Jammu and Kashmir
OL,20,Ffollowing Moslem protests and extremist
OL,21,Fviolence against Indian rule.
OL,23,D]FFromG14-03-90F/ teletextarchive.com
